@startuml

[*] --> alive : peer inserted / heartbeat observed

alive --> alive : PING/PONG observed\nor indirect evidence refreshed
alive --> suspected : phi >= suspect threshold
suspected --> suspected : phi stays in suspect band
suspected --> dead : phi >= dead threshold
suspected --> alive : heartbeat observed
dead --> alive : heartbeat observed
dead --> dead : no direct recovery evidence

note right of alive
Local status only.
Status transitions are evaluated by the local
phi-accrual failure detector and then disseminated.
end note

@enduml
